# npm workspace install strategy for Expo.
#
# Expo's React Native toolchain expects a *hoisted* node_modules tree. Isolated
# (non-hoisted) installs make autolinking and native module resolution behave
# differently, and Expo's own monorepo guide advises against isolated layouts when
# a native module cannot be resolved. npm's default is already `hoisted`; this
# line simply makes that intent explicit instead of implicit.
#
# Reference: https://docs.expo.dev/guides/monorepos/
install-strategy=hoisted